Package: treelayout
Title: Tree Layout Algorithms
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Guangchuang", "Yu", email = "guangchuangyu@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6485-8781"))
    )
Description: Computes node coordinates for phylogenetic trees and other
    tree-like structures. Given a tree, returns one row per node with x and
    y coordinates, ready for plotting by any graphics system. This is the
    layout engine used by the 'ggtree' package, extracted so that the
    coordinate computation can be used without a plotting dependency.
